Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-所以是女巫  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we're thinking witch?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们总是把自己的体液吐的到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're always spewing their bodily fluids everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且为什么老不放过兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is a rabbit alway get screwed in the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烧死女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn witch, burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这子弹是能杀女巫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are witch killing bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说你会需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you you'd need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不是一个团队吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we not a team?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得...不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是从不吸取教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never learn, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总是要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always try to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(阿肯色州  尤里卡斯普林斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  能不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, do you mind if...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别拿去买酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't buy a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  斯黛茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Stacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是流浪汉  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a bum, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很需要用一下电话  可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just somebody who really needs to use the phone, you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(未知来电者)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... well, where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really sure about that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(沃尔多华夫饼)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吃华夫饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about Waffles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢问题  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb question, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么样的疯子才会不爱吃华夫饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What psycho doesn't love waffles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,软糯糯的  浇上糖浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're fluffy, little pockets full of syrup
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喷上奶油  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just cover with whipped cream, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  去沃尔多华夫饼店跟我碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, meet me at Waldo's, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带没带...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring any...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你很需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like you could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚挺累吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough night?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上也不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rougn morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不过是出去买饭吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you just run out to get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定是断片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从宿醉的程度来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And judging from this hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定可嗨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was ephic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你打电话来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I tried to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个嘛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道是怎么发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure how that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  我给妈妈发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll text mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让她知道有情况来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure she knows to go over to me in case of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一他找到了凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case he tracks down Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法私生子的准妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of Lucifer's love child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  魔鬼宝宝妈那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the devil baby mama drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快速地说五遍试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that five times fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼宝宝妈那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil baby mama drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也玩够了  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a good run, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是稍稍刹住点\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe let's pump the breaks a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:04:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不是二十岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're not twenty anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派对到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you rack that party till the day they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And B,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是能干翻你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来点华夫饼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a man need some waffles down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不用了  -天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh no, I'm fine. - Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你来点吧  -行了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just take it easy. - No, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停尸房十分钟后就开门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, the morgue opens in like ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}The morgue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尸检结果啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... autopsy results.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还醉着呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, our case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个喉咙里被塞满了钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead guy, throat stuffed full of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yes, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个会计  巴瑞·吉尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The accountant, Barry Gilman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-对  -对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得是恶魔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he got his ticket punched by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但我们昨天去了他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but we went over to his place yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a whole bunch of jack, and a little bit of squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有巫术袋  没有电磁场  没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no hex bag, no EMF, no sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不算是案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, no case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是案子  那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if it's not a case, then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  金钱夺命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, death by money?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他是被...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the guy got whacked by a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有黑色幽默感的黑帮分子杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some mob dude, with a ironic sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去看看他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go look at the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想再跟华夫饼单独待会儿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to spend some more alone time with waffles...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好好玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你付钱了吗  -好吧  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you pay? - Oh, well. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚肯定老嗨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epic night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  再有需要会叫你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We'll let you know if we need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正式死因是窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So cause of death was suffocation. Officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"见B1-4号证据"  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"See evidence bag B 1-4." All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说是都是从他胃里取出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says they pulled all this from his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早餐吃多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说什么黑色幽默的黑帮分子来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying about an ironic mobster?
