Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仇家  没错  就那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy. Yeah. Those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他坑了不该坑的人的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he blew the wrong person's savings.
