Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...没印象...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I...No. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她  华夫饼店那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's -- it's her from, uh, from the waffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想道歉  最好快点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna apologize, you better make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我道歉  是你打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me apologize? Uh, you smacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是你犯浑  我们扯平了  -扯平什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were being a dick. We're even. - Even for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你的...你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's none of your -- Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  不管我们是怎么了  对不起  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, whatever happened with us, um, I'm sorry. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的  我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, here's the deal. We're, um, we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是联调局的  穆恩和恩威瑟探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're FBI. Uh, Agents Moon and Entwistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-联调局  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- FBI? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚还说你叫斯普林斯汀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, you told me your name was Springsteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟"老板"一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like The Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:15:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我们得撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, see, sometimes, we have to lie in order to, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好掩护身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}to... protect our cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不会吧  -好吧  这事很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. - Okay, listen, this is actually sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为我搭档可能被下了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we think my partner may have been roofied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吧  -不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously. - Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能告诉我们那晚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can tell us anything about what happened that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.93,0:15:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会对我们大有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  我...  -太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. I... - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他点了汉堡带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ordered burgers to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他等一会儿  当时人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gonna be a minute. We were slammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你喝了...四杯龙舌兰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you knocked back... four shots of tequila?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.89,0:15:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还点了些挺"酷"的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some "sick jams" on the juke,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后上了公牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you hit the bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他什么  -我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He what? - I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你一走进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you had the hots for Larry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就看好拉瑞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as you walked in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他...你骑了拉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He -- You rode Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我厉害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were...amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们聊了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to talking, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们活动了下筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We blew off some steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他跟别人说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see him talk with anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的酒保说他急匆匆地跑了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bartender said she saw him run out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像裤子着火了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like his pants caught fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们说好关门后碰面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to meet up after close-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你根本没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小可怜  你被人下了药啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing. You were all roofed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是有意占你便宜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I took advantage of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方有监控吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this place have security cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久以来第一次搞上妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}First action in I don't know how long,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果却完全不记得  真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's like it never even happened. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就很好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now that's comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  那是我  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, whoa. There I am. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在读我的唇语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to read my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"现在莎莎舞你连指手套"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Now salsa you mittens""
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会读唇语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't read lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会读唇语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't read lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这应该就是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course. I think we got our witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't remember any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像在网飞上看自己一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like watching myself on Netflix.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(吉尔曼  吉尔伯特事务所)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人眼熟吗  那件外衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy look familiar to you? That jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  蠢问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. Stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴瑞办公室里好像有张他的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Barry had a picture of him in his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能你昨晚就是这样认出了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be how you recognized him last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to shoot a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你撞在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you crashed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你往那边跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀巫师的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch-killing bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这世上还有巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巫师是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}witches are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼  狼人  巫师  都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires, werewolves, witches, they're all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  这太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  等等  灯神不满足愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so wait. So -- so djinns don't grant wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海妖并非都是辣妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sirens aren't all hot chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  抱歉戳破你的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry to break it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真是疯了  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is crazy. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我居然来给你做"教育"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me giving you "The talk""
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我们有多少次不得不告诉普通平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many times we've had to tell some civilian
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怪物是真的吗  -但怪物的确是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that monsters are real? - Yeah, but monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是杀他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're the guys that kill 'em, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  这工作太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. Best job ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  如果你喜欢油腻腻的餐馆食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. If you like greasy diner food,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破烂的旅馆房间  不止一次的天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}crappy motels rooms, more than one Apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  听上去我们是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We kinda sound like heroes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好的朋友还是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our best friend's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶紧治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta get you cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个  太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, these? Freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那只是雕文\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're just, uh, glyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巫师在施咒时会用到  但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches use them in spells, but I've actually
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从没见过这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许罗威娜能认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Rowena will recognize 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧  罗威娜是谁  好奇怪的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Who's Rowena? That's a weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-S-Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a dead guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那应该就是我们找的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think that's our witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩  杀死巫师本该是解决办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean. Killing the witch was supposed to be the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他已经死了  那你为什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if he's already dead, then why aren't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这里  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we get out of here. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的吉迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Gideon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.59,0:20:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他叫我们别去动那个会计师的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why he told us to leave the accountant alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:21:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那混蛋偷了我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tub of guts stole from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserved what he got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们发现我们了  凯特  我们得跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on us, Cat. We have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不管吉迪恩说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't care what Gideon said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你还想杀了他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? You wanna kill them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要回我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my family back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a dead guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从没见过死人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen a dead guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你见过的  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you have. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  迪恩  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, D-Dean, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来中咒程度又加深了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell's progressed, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要的是情报  罗威娜  不是上门服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted intel, Rowena, not a house call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉你会谢谢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have a feeling you'll come to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头发  好有弹性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair, it's all so bouncy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们非要治好他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-罗威娜  -萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rowena. - Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们发现的雕文是古凯尔特语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those glyphs you found are an archaic form of Celtic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧甘文支\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ogham Chraobh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德鲁伊人将其用于他们的仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Druids used it in their rituals,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,称之为"树的语言"\N{\fnArial\fs30}calling it the "Language of the Trees."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  树还会说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Now the trees are talkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你记得HBO吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do you remember HBO?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电影频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinemax?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成人电影频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinemax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.77,0:22:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. All right, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sit you down right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是要成人电影直播吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This like live Skinemax or...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout two?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.55,0:22:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  坐着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个巫师家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one family of witches
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,善用这种魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}versed in this kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他们早死绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought them all dead for years, but
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但看到那雕文后\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I saw those glyphs...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.55,0:22:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是其中之一吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this one of 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩·洛克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gideon Loughlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:22:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  跟我讲讲他们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tell me about this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.61,0:23:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一百年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛克兰家族从旧世界迁至这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Loughlins came over from the Old World and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将密西西比三角洲的一个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned a small town on the Mississippi Delta
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成了他们自己的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}into their own personal fiefdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的孩子  吉迪恩  博伊德和凯特琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their children -- Gideon, Boyd, and Catriona --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一棵树上结的三个烂果子\N{\fnArial\fs30}were like three rotten little peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家人有一本强大的咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family possessed a powerful spell book,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德鲁伊魔法典籍  《黑魔法书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tome of Druidic magic called the Black Grimoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.93,0:23:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自世界各地的巫师去跟他们同住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches came from around the world to live with them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学习其中奥秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and study its secrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.37,0:23:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened to 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  我听说有一两个活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I'd heard rumors one or two survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走了他们的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}stealing away with their book,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.95,0:23:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我只当作是谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I-I dismissed them as gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Gideonn dead
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想打破你哥哥中的咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to break the curse on your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to find that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不能打破吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. So you can't break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.19,0:24:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如此复杂的巫术需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but witchcraft this complex would take time,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.85,0:24:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而迪恩剩的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than Dean's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经开始遗忘自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already begun to forget himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.79,0:24:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有他认识  爱过的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone he's ever known, ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.33,0:24:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快他会忘记如何说话  如何吞咽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon he'll forget how to speak, how to swallow,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.79,0:24:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那哥们好惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.82,0:24:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么经历了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要死在这事上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. This is what nails me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.07,0:24:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, Dean, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.94,0:24:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna happen, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚跟我说了我一生的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just told me my whole life story.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I gotta be honest, man, I...I can feel it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.95,0:24:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在渐渐遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}slipping out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀怪物是一码事  但这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, ganking monsters is one thing. But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, we're gonna, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.00,0:25:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会有办法的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.77,0:25:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.69,0:25:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真关心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过我哥哥死  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've seen my brother die, but
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着他变得\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching him become...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.68,0:25:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不像他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}not him...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这恐怕更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might actually be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.84,0:25:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.98,0:25:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·温彻斯特是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Winchester is my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Cast--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:25:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到那本魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find that grimoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.78,0:26:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.41,0:26:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这就是你的目的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. That's your angle, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.15,0:26:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出现了厉害的魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A powerful spell book shows up
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.35,0:26:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你突然就跑来帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of a sudden, you're here to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,利他主义并非你的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altruism isn't exactly your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.41,0:26:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  让温家人欠你个人情总是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, it never hurts to have a Winchester owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫迪恩·温...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dean Wi--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.22,0:26:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name -- my name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:26:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My... .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is -- is...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.94,0:27:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩·洛克兰的地址在他会计师的档案里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gideon Loughlin's address was in his accountant's file.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.61,0:27:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果书在他那儿  我能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the book is there, I'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.13,0:27:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  你会需要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you'll need me there to help --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  你留下陪迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you're staying here with Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I most certainly am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能跟我来  我也不能丢下他一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he can't come with me, and I'm not leaving him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我显然并不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I obviously don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.55,0:27:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.95,0:27:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《黑魔法书》是用古德鲁伊语写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Grimoire's written in ancient Druid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.67,0:27:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是没有我  你怎么能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you propose to find a proper spell
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.47,0:27:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,合适的咒语来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}without me there to --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说洛克兰家还有几个人活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you said a few of the Loughlins survived, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.18,0:27:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谣传是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.46,0:27:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你指望他们家的人来...怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you expect one of them to -- to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.83,0:27:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为你翻译他们的远古绝密咒语书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Translate their ancient super secret family spell book for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.75,0:27:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚杀了他们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just killed their brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.55,0:27:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们更想剥了你的皮当衣服穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd sooner use your skin as an outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.61,0:27:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.51,0:28:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My...my...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别乱碰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop touching everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿这个玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你讲个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.07,0:28:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.67,0:28:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从前  有个美丽的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, a beautiful witch was,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.69,0:28:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被一群自大  自命不凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}again, run out of her homeland
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来势汹汹的混混赶出了家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}by those pompous, self-righteous, murderous hooligans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.63,0:28:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是英国记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know them as The British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去一个巫师家庭寻求庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sought refuge with a family of witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.66,0:28:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不过是想要个住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she wanted was a roof over her head
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个供她磨练魔法的安全之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a safe place to hone her magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们把她赶了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, they threw her out like...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.56,0:29:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像她是垃圾  说她没那个本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}like common trash. Said she wasn't up to snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.17,0:29:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些巫师听上去真浑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, these witches sound like dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.09,0:29:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你特别有本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got plenty of snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是什么都不记得了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can really remember nothing, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能不记得自己做过的事真是恩赐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a gift not to recall the things you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.79,0:29:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个杀手  迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a killer, Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.23,0:29:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.90,0:29:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I...I kill people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.98,0:29:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.19,0:29:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你虽然是个顽固的讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}though you may be a stubborn pain in the arse
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.93,0:29:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且毫无礼貌可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the manners of a Neanderthal
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.16,0:29:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭像个三岁孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the dining habits of a toddler,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything you've done, you've done...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.01,0:30:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是为了大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.74,0:30:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么就没事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that's supposed to make it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.28,0:30:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.21,0:30:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help those other than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.39,0:30:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.86,0:30:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做过可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done horrible things,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还安慰自己那没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I told myself it was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.64,0:30:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是权力的代价  权力才最重要  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the price of power. And power's what matters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我遇见了上帝和他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I met God and his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.08,0:30:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全宇宙最厉害的两个人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two most powerful beings in the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.82,0:30:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然浪费权力跟彼此拌嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasting it on squabbling with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想  如果他们都不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, if -- if they can't be happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.70,0:30:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}or at least satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我还有什么希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}how can there be any hope for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跟我说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.89,0:30:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道你不会记得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know you won't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.73,0:31:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(萨姆·温)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你进去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.99,0:31:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我拿到翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I get the translation,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.87,0:31:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you cast the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这枪里都是杀巫师的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gun is full of witch-killing bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.99,0:31:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去找你的魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you go to your grimoire
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么打破记忆咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me how to break the memory spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.42,0:31:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.77,0:31:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博伊德想去找你  但我说  "何必"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyd wanted to go after you, but I said, "Why bother?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.97,0:31:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.12,0:31:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll hunt us down,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.26,0:31:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}right at our doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.22,0:32:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像披萨一样新鲜得热气腾腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot and... fresh like pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.14,0:32:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再说一遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.75,0:32:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.22,0:32:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.70,0:33:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟被巫师绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}"Your brother's been kidnapped by a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.86,0:33:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了你的破车  把你丢在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found your stupid car and left you here."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.82,0:33:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.03,0:33:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(别乱跑)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.82,0:33:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stay."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博伊德  你保证过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyd, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.41,0:33:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有吉迪恩  我们就不是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without Gideon, we are not a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.62,0:33:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你背着他把那个会计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you should've thought of that before
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.81,0:33:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成彩罐之前就该想到这点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you went behind his back and pinata'd the accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.87,0:33:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩叫你别纠结的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gideon told you to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.51,0:33:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们被一个一无是处的人类欺骗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let us be cheated by some sniveling, weak human nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你害死了我们的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got our brother killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.59,0:33:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.19,0:33:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以复活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}can bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.27,0:33:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.03,0:33:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你  为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.85,0:34:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特琳娜·洛克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catriona Loughlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.06,0:34:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岁月无情啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The years have not been kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.40,0:34:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜·麦克劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena MacLeod?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.17,0:34:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.53,0:34:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.87,0:34:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看是谁醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.30,0:34:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你妹妹计划了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so whatever your sister has planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.37,0:34:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.16,0:34:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用你的灵魂换他的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, swapping your soul for his?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.47,0:34:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我非得做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.77,0:34:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破烂娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raggedy Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.86,0:34:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.13,0:35:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们门口蜷成一团的破娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}a rag doll all huddled up on our doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓我能看到虱子啃食着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore I could see the fleas nibbling away
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那具残破\N{\fnArial\fs30}at whatever the hell was left of that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肮脏的驱壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}dirty little body of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.93,0:35:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.16,0:35:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还觉得自己配学习我们的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}still, you thought you were worthy of our magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.06,0:35:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们提出异议时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we disagreed...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.79,0:35:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那么哀求我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you begged,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫不顾忌面子\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you threw yourself down and...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要向我们每个人献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}offered yourself to each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博伊德差点就心动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyd almost took you up on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我说  上只猪都更干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I told him, it would be cleaner with the pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.98,0:35:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道人怎么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.20,0:35:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么比撕开新伤口更能治愈老伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing heals old wounds like opening fresh ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(别乱跑)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.82,0:36:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(打开我)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(不行)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.72,0:36:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(杀巫师的子弹)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(这把枪)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.94,0:36:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我就是个小姑娘  小破烂娃娃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm just a little girl, I'm Raggedy Ann. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.59,0:36:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 破烂娃娃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, Raggedy Ann. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.07,0:36:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 快要散架 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Falling apart. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.50,0:36:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 线也开裂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ At the seams. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.43,0:36:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向不太会投飞镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been very good at darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:36:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.21,0:37:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 就是个小姑娘  破烂娃娃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just a little girl, Raggedy Ann. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.66,0:37:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 破烂娃娃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, Raggedy Ann. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.80,0:37:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.85,0:37:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得那杀得了一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think that's gonna work on a...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(杀巫师的子弹)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.30,0:37:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  弟弟  巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Brother. Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.03,0:38:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了吗  好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Is that it? Is -- is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.06,0:38:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这小子是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this hippie?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.36,0:38:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他的表情啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.46,0:38:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我把你的万圣节糖果都吃掉了的那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the time when I ate all your Halloween candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.21,0:38:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗  太经典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that? Classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.83,0:38:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.91,0:38:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然叫来了罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you called Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.22,0:38:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然骑了拉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you rode Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在那头公牛上很厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was awesome on that bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.26,0:38:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像神一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was like a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.43,0:38:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你记起了什么中咒期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, should you experience any odd memories
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的记忆  或对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}from when you were hexed, conversations,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:38:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you let me know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.79,0:39:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分都不记得了  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's blank, mostly. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.10,0:39:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想感谢我  给我寄个礼品篮就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to thank me, you can send a wee gift basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.53,0:39:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.92,0:39:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.34,0:39:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们欠你个小人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you one. Small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.52,0:39:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咒语解除后你感觉还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you holding up after the spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意把我整的好惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing kicked my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.96,0:39:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.71,0:39:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我起初有点嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually, uh, a little jealous at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒什么  差点害死我的咒语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what? The curse that nearly killed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.45,0:39:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们做的一些事  一直是我们的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of the things we've done, we've had this weight for...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.45,0:39:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.21,0:39:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到那消失  你是那么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And seeing it gone, uh, you looked happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.51,0:39:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉负担是不是好事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, was it nice to drop our baggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧  很可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe. Hell, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.98,0:40:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但遗失的不止是烂事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't just the crap that got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.18,0:40:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们  我们的工作  那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was us, it was what we do, you know? All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.87,0:40:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.45,0:40:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果那就是开心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what being happy looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.19,0:40:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.38,0:40:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是亮亮的那个  -上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the, uh, the shiny one that's - Get in the car.

